    {
        "text": "Anthony, you and Robin okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#3",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#3",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine. I got Robin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems like the whole prison's power went out. It's pitch dark here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is an opportunity for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "text": "It feels like the tower crashed straight through the floor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're probably at the second floor basement. Still some distance away from the clinic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#3",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, we should get going before the jailers get here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Robin, are you okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-Is it really a good thing that I'm okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't let it get to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "I did tell you before you could keep trying to kill me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you think you betrayed me for what you did, let me tell you this\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm afraid none of us are close enough to talk about trust just yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, not even me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_264_Mountain_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not even you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, come on, that's cold.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kafka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_264_Mountain_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wouldn't you say it's more problematic to completely trust a person after just a few months?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, I am a little disappointed, but that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nonetheless, I'm curious. I can tell you weren't acting when we were working together. You can't fake those emotions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you do this, Robin?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "My father. He made lots of money, and he was nice to me. I'm proud of him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But one day, his company went bankrupt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "And he's been a failure ever since.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "So he changed. He started drinking a lot, and he got angry. He hated everything around him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "My mother left him. He was heavily in debt, and in the end, went into the hospital with liver problems, and so many other complications I don't even get the details of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "My mother tried to talk me into moving in with her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I never forgot how well my father used to treat me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wanted to do something for him. So I gave up my hobbies. I tried taking on all kinds of jobs, but the medical bills kept coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, one day, someone came to me. He said he could give me lots of money. I just had to kill someone for him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And I'm the target.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. I can't offer you anything, and that's why you made this choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#3",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, he's been watching you here, dressed as a jailer. His name is Jesselton.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "After you made me the offer, he found me and told me\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "The very last thing that the Simons did was destroy my father's company.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#3",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My goodness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, not only should I not hold this against you, I must apologize.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, don't apologize. That isn't what I'm trying to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#3",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not like that, Anthony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew I was doin' wrong. I knew I shouldn't do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But I gave up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't know what I was supposed to do, otherwise. I just didn't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm tired. My mother wanted me to make a choice, my father wanted me to make a choice, life wanted me to make a choice, Jesselton wanted me to make a choice, and even you wanted me to make a choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't wanna make any choices. I don't wanna judge what's right or what's wrong, good or bad. I just don't want to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 40,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sick of it! Why do I have to choose?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But, you know, Robin, you can't just hand off your decisions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have to think everything through and make your own choices. Then, you need to take responsibility for each of those choices.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise, you'll never be able to take your fate into your own hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the most important thing I've learned during my years here in prison.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "Strength is important, and so is intelligence, but the most important trait of all is courage. The courage to make your own decisions and pay the price for them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm afraid of making wrong decisions myself, but I can't let that get in the way of making decisions at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "I used to think I had no one to rely on because I hadn't found anyone reliable, but I've come to realize there is no one we can truly rely on anywhere in this world.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "No one but ourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Robin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_451_robin#6",
        "name2": "char_264_Mountain_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry I didn't notice your pain in time, Robin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must reiterate. What you've done almost ruined my escape plan. That's why I won't forgive you so easily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nonetheless, as someone who has suffered a similar situation, I hope you can forget about all this for the time being.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anthony"
    },
    {
        "text": "You must scrutinize yourself and think about what it is that you want to do.",
